{"id":"snowman-in-the-freezer","title":"The Snowman in the Freezer","level":6,"series":"Dash Adventures","cover":{"h":"27c3fce12939b2bcce19c5b5399a5866","t":"image/webp"},"titleAudio":null,"cast":[{"role":"hero","name":"Logan","portrait":{"h":"cf541143e9c73f6a4921ebd5175623cb","t":"image/webp"}},{"role":"sister","name":"Anastasia","portrait":{"h":"4b8a1a7bc845473e95a93b7d3c7d3a7d","t":"image/webp"}},{"role":"dad","name":"Dad","portrait":{"h":"4a3effd5da379d9c095d2ece4f986c49","t":"image/webp"}},{"role":"mum","name":"Mum","portrait":{"h":"4e8d5c2035e2129d567a2a2bbf62e944","t":"image/webp"}},{"role":"dash","name":"Dash","portrait":{"h":"5394e0f1443cd76f83368aaf141c3340","t":"image/webp"}}],"mystery":null,"practise":["white","make","nose","stones","smiles","slide","skate","save"],"common":["they","have","oh","comes","two","puts"],"challenge":["snow","snowman","snowball","carrot","freezer","melting"],"before":"What happens to a snowman when the sun comes out?","after":["What made the snowman come alive?","Why was the snowman melting?","How did Logan save him?","What would you do with a snowman friend?"],"retell":[2,4,6,9,12,14],"pages":[{"text":"It is a snow day! The garden is white.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"52ff02b72a8dcd6d6020bec4718733e5","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"The back garden (a cosy British terraced house with a small back garden, a lawn and a wooden shed) covered in thick snow, flakes falling, the shed with a snowy ","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Logan and Anastasia make a snowman.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"b905c70ca697cf3ddb7153cc9e4fe76b","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Logan and Anastasia roll a big snowball for the body while Dash rolls a small one for the head.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Dash puts on a carrot nose and two stones.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"4af5a704eb611bb1188480dd99b235d7","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Dash stands on Logan's shoulders pushing a carrot nose into the snowman's face.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Then the snowman blinks... and smiles!","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"db00e64306a5866863ceedae8890a760","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Magic: the snowman's stone eyes blink and a big smile spreads across his face.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"The snowman waves his stick arms.","bubble":{"who":"snowman","name":"Snowman","text":"Let's play!","side":"right"},"image":{"h":"e1626b4b2849e5e9888893cdf7bc692e","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"The snowman waves his twiggy arms happily.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"They slide down the hill on a tray.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"4a5af57aba4ed071e3e143ddc99b3160","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"A snowy park hill: the snowman slides down on a big tea tray with Logan, Anastasia and Dash piled on behind him, everyone cheering, snow spraying.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"They skate on the pond.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"949fbbb6be19b515d6203793534b28d6","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"A frozen pond: the snowman skates gracefully, the children wobble, and Dash spins on his tail.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"They have a snowball game. The snowman wins!","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"0bbb73804537537a9ae5d7dc7cf5c4d8","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"A snowball game: the snowman juggles three snowballs while Logan and Anastasia duck behind a snow wall, laughing.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"The next day, the sun comes out. Drip, drip, drip...","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"453a19b8f7cabb457e0829eee2cbe7e4","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"A bright sunny morning, snow melting from the roofs.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Anastasia runs out to the snowman.","bubble":{"who":"sister","name":"Anastasia","text":"Oh no! He is melting!","side":"left"},"image":{"h":"e9c568fc0a9cf0ac713a82a80e1c6b1c","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Anastasia runs across the slushy garden in pyjamas and wellies, looking worried.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Logan has a plan. The freezer!","bubble":{"who":"hero","name":"Logan","text":"We must save him!","side":"left"},"image":{"h":"21be7607ed15e4625f9b5099aca2a90d","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Logan has a lightbulb-moment face, pointing towards the kitchen.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"They tuck the snowman in the freezer, next to the peas.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"d5a0182f5d17fb283f0ecb9ff1a883c8","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"In the kitchen: a big chest freezer open with frosty mist.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Then Dad gets the peas for tea.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"aa59f6b5575626b43cd208489b7cbe09","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Evening: Dad in an apron opens the chest freezer lid and reaches in without looking, whistling.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"AAAH! The snowman waves at Dad!","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"31803a789c46b86747af84fbc0c6920d","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Dad jumps back in shock and frozen peas fly everywhere.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Now the snowman is safe... and Dad has a new pal!","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"744344b663c2f54afac5d24308c7f0e0","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Dad laughs and shares an ice lolly with the snowman at the open freezer.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}}],"words":{}}